From aea8940ce1cbc2584cedf50ecbbf1f1810b4cfa4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 27 May 2026 04:03:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] feat: migrate database from MongoDB to Firebase Firestore

- Replace mongoose with firebase-admin v12
- Rewrite all 8 service files using Firestore Admin SDK
- Update passport middleware to use Firestore for user lookup
- Update account controller to use Firestore document ID (id) instead of MongoDB _id
- Add firebase.config.js with Firestore initialization and docToObj helper
- Add _id alias in all Firestore responses for frontend backward compatibility
- Support FieldValue.increment() (replaces MongoDB $inc)
- Support arrayUnion/arrayRemove (replaces MongoDB $push/$pull)
- Support Firestore count() (replaces MongoDB countDocuments)
- Implement word prefix search using Firestore range queries
- Remove MONGO_URL env vars, add FIREBASE_* env vars in .local.env
- Keep all API routes and controllers unchanged
- Add FIREBASE_MIGRATION.md with setup instructions and required indexes

