From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 27 May 2026 06:45:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] feat: add vocabulary & sentence seeding scripts with API
 enrichment

backend/scripts/seedWords.js:
  - 334 words across 16 topics (animals, food, family, body, colors,
    weather, sports, travel, technology, nature, work, education,
    health, clothes, house, common)
  - CEFR levels: A1 (139), A2 (85), B1 (78), B2 (32)
  - All words include Vietnamese meanings (mean field)
  - Auto-enriches from Free Dictionary API (no key needed):
    phonetic, audioUrl (MP3), note (English definition),
    synonyms, antonyms, examples
  - Auto-fetches images from Pixabay API (PIXABAY_API_KEY env)
  - 300ms rate limiting + 3x retry logic
  - CLI: --topic, --level, --dry-run, --force, --skip-image, --skip-audio

backend/scripts/seedSentences.js:
  - 100 curated sentences across 7 topics (greetings, daily_life,
    travel, food, work, education, weather)
  - CEFR levels: A1 (25), A2 (26), B1 (31), B2 (18)
  - Each sentence: Vietnamese translation + grammar note
  - Batch writes (400/batch) to Firestore sentences collection
  - CLI: --topic, --level, --dry-run, --force

