+ *   - Saves to Firestore `words` collection
+ *   - Rate limiting: 300ms between API calls
+ *   - Retry logic: 3 retries with 1s delay
+ *
+ * Usage:
+ *   cd backend
+ *   node scripts/seedWords.js
+ *   node scripts/seedWords.js --topic animals
+ *   node scripts/seedWords.js --level A1
+ *   node scripts/seedWords.js --dry-run
+ *   node scripts/seedWords.js --force
+ *   node scripts/seedWords.js --skip-image
+ *   node scripts/seedWords.js --skip-audio
+ *   node scripts/seedWords.js --topic food --level A1 --dry-run
+ *
+ * Environment variables required:
+ *   FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID, FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY, FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL  (Firebase)
+ *   PIXABAY_API_KEY  (optional – skip with --skip-image)
+ * ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+ */
+
