From c8bddfffc38822923e8a3a0ce0e92bdeaa6e768b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 31 May 2026 09:42:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] feat: add 6 IOE-style games + real-time multiplayer room
 system
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Colorful game hub with 10 games (animated cards, hover effects, MỚI badge)
- 6 new IOE-style games for children:
  1. WordOrder: scrambled letter chips → assemble the word (30s timer)
  2. FillLetters: fill in blanked letters of a word (text input)
  3. MemoryMatch: 4×4 card flip game, word ↔ Vietnamese meaning pairs
  4. BasketballQuiz: MCQ with 🏀 throw animation on correct answer
  5. MountainClimb: MCQ with climbing progress bar, streak bonus
  6. ListenChoose: hear Google TTS audio, click correct image (2×2 grid)
- Real-time multiplayer (Kahoot-style):
  - Backend: game.service.js with 6-digit PIN rooms in Firestore gameRooms collection
  - Create/join room, start game, submit answers with speed+streak scoring
  - Host controls question advancement; all players see live leaderboard
  - Frontend polls room state every 2s for real-time leaderboard updates
  - Guest identity via localStorage (no auth required to play)
- Backend API: POST/GET /apis/games/room/* (create, join, start, answer, next, get)
- Score formula: 500 base + 500 speed bonus + 2× multiplier at 5+ streak

